<mjml lang="pt-BR">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Cia da Torta | Último dia da Semana 09.09</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Último dia: na compra de 10 produtos, o décimo sai por apenas R$0,99.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Nunito" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;700;800;900&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-breakpoint width="480px" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Nunito, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text padding="0" />
      <mj-image padding="0" border="0" />
      <mj-button border-radius="100px" font-family="Nunito, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-weight="900" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      a { color: inherit; }
    </mj-style>
    <mj-style>
      @media only screen and (max-width:620px) {
        .content-pad > table > tbody > tr > td { padding:34px 28px 28px !important; }
        .footer-pad > table > tbody > tr > td { padding:28px 28px 24px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f5e7da" width="600px">
    <mj-section background-color="#5a1800" padding="20px 42px 18px">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-image src="https://leonardoffaria.github.io/ciadatorta-emails/semana-0909-ultimo-dia-099/footer-logo.png?v=1" href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-ultimo-dia&amp;utm_content=logo" width="112px" alt="Cia da Torta" align="left" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-image src="https://leonardoffaria.github.io/ciadatorta-emails/semana-0909-ultimo-dia-099/header.jpg?v=1" href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-ultimo-dia&amp;utm_content=header" width="600px" alt="Mini tortas artesanais Cia da Torta" fluid-on-mobile="true" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="30px 58px 28px">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-text align="center" color="#b22000" font-size="12px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.6px" padding="0 0 10px">ÚLTIMO DIA</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#6f293b" font-size="34px" font-weight="900" line-height="1" letter-spacing="0.2px" padding="0 0 12px">SEMANA 09.09</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#5a1800" font-size="19px" font-weight="900" line-height="1.25" padding="0 0 22px">A cada 10 produtos comprados,<br />1 sai por apenas R$0,99</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-ultimo-dia&amp;utm_content=header-cta" background-color="#6f293b" color="#ffffff" font-size="14px" inner-padding="13px 25px" padding="0">GARANTA AGORA</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="content-pad" background-color="#ffffff" padding="8px 70px 30px">
      <mj-column padding="0">
        <mj-text align="center" color="#1f1410" font-size="16px" line-height="1.48" padding="0 0 20px">
          <strong style="font-weight:800;">Hoje é o último dia da Semana 09.09!</strong> Ainda dá tempo de aproveitar a oferta e escolher as delícias que você quer ter por perto. 💛
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#1f1410" font-size="16px" line-height="1.48" padding="0 0 20px">
          <strong style="font-weight:800;">Na compra de 10 produtos da Cia da Torta, o décimo item sai por apenas R$0,99.</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#1f1410" font-size="16px" line-height="1.48" padding="0 0 20px">
          Escolha entre mini tortas doces e salgadas, mini quiches e sucos, e aproveite essa última chance para montar o seu pedido.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#1f1410" font-size="16px" line-height="1.48" padding="0 0 24px">
          <strong style="font-weight:800;">A oferta termina hoje. Garanta os seus favoritos antes que acabe!</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-ultimo-dia&amp;utm_content=cta" background-color="#ef3824" color="#ffffff" font-size="15px" inner-padding="14px 25px" padding="0">APROVEITE A OFERTA</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#4b3a33" font-size="10px" font-style="italic" line-height="1.45" padding="22px 0 0">
          Oferta válida por tempo limitado. Ao adicionar 10 produtos ao carrinho, o item de menor valor terá seu preço alterado automaticamente para R$0,99.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="footer-pad" background-color="#5a1800" padding="28px 58px 20px">
      <mj-column width="36%" padding="0 18px 0 0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-image src="https://leonardoffaria.github.io/ciadatorta-emails/semana-0909-ultimo-dia-099/footer-logo.png?v=1" href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=semana-0909-ultimo-dia&amp;utm_content=footer-logo" width="112px" alt="Cia da Torta" align="left" padding="0 0 18px" />
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.5">Sabores artesanais feitos com carinho para o seu dia a dia.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="31%" padding="0 14px 0 0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.7">
          <a href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/perguntas-frequentes" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Perguntas Frequentes</a><br />
          <a href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/privacidade" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Privacidade e Cookies</a><br />
          <a href="https://ciadatorta.com.br/termos-de-uso" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Termos de uso</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="33%" padding="0" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text align="left" color="#ffffff" font-size="10px" line-height="1.7">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ciadatortaoficial/" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Instagram</a><br />
          <a href="https://wa.me/5511924565515" target="_blank" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">11 92456-5515</a><br />
          <a href="mailto:contato@ciadatorta.com.br" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Contato</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="100%" padding="0">
        <mj-text align="center" color="#f6d6a4" font-size="10px" line-height="1.5" padding="22px 0 0">
          <a href="{{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}" style="color:#f6d6a4;text-decoration:underline;">Descadastre-se</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
